Mob Amputation

This project is a modified port and adaptation of Mob-Amputation by iChun:
https://github.com/iChun/Mob-Amputation

Source for this adaptation:
https://github.com/AvacadoWizard120/LimbBGone

Original work and authorship: iChun
Port and modifications: AvacadoWizard120

This port is not an unmodified upstream release. It targets Minecraft versions
outside the original mod's support boundary and adapts the implementation for
modern Minecraft versions and multiple mod loaders. The port is being made with
iChun's express permission.

This adaptation is distributed under LGPL-3.0-only, matching the conservatively
versioned LGPL terms of the upstream work. See COPYING and COPYING.LESSER for
the applicable GNU GPL v3 and GNU LGPL v3 license texts. Both files accompany
the source repository and packaged mod artifacts.
